  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146450",
      "title": "Using the \"next-auth\" Session Provider Component",
      "lectureOrder": 408,
      "videoOrder": 376,
      "sourceHash": "0854c80f8c0ec4211ac55e7586c9b9f2a3cd5b1c0e8e1604238f7d8dd67d15a7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "Now we made good progress",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 7.12,
          "en": "before we explored as change Password feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.12,
          "end": 8.13,
          "en": "and all of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 10.88,
          "en": "There is a little optimization, which you could",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.88,
          "end": 12.98,
          "en": "consider implementing, especially if you had",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.98,
          "end": 14.96,
          "en": "a bigger Application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.96,
          "end": 18.07,
          "en": "At the moment, we're using this session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.07,
          "end": 21.41,
          "en": "functionality in a couple of different components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.41,
          "end": 22.243,
          "en": "To be precise we use use session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.243,
          "end": 26.38,
          "en": "in the Main Navigation component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.38,
          "end": 27.823,
          "en": "Now, one problem we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.823,
          "end": 32.823,
          "en": "with that is that if we are authenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 37.24,
          "en": "and I reload whilst on this profile page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.24,
          "end": 40.67,
          "en": "then we figure out whether the user is authenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.67,
          "end": 45.67,
          "en": "or not in that get service side props function of that page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.94,
          "end": 48.84,
          "en": "here, this function runs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.84,
          "end": 53.75,
          "en": "and then after the page was loaded, does use session hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.75,
          "end": 56.02,
          "en": "which we use and Main Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.02,
          "end": 59.39,
          "en": "We'll technically also, again, run some logic to find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.39,
          "end": 62.08,
          "en": "out whether we have a session or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.08,
          "end": 65.17,
          "en": "And we see this here in the Network tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.17,
          "end": 68.6,
          "en": "If I reload, you see there is a request being",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.6,
          "end": 72.826,
          "en": "sent to /api/auth/session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.826,
          "end": 77.826,
          "en": "That request is actually sent by that use session hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.5,
          "end": 81.47,
          "en": "And it's sent to check Whether that session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.47,
          "end": 83.44,
          "en": "which had found is valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.44,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "because we can't validate that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 89.02,
          "en": "with client site JavaScript for security reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.02,
          "end": 91.82,
          "en": "Hence that cookie needs to be sent to an end point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.82,
          "end": 95.53,
          "en": "which then determines whether it is valid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.53,
          "end": 98.00999999999999,
          "en": "So that's why this request is being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.00999999999999,
          "end": 100.72,
          "en": "There is nothing wrong with this request, but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.72,
          "end": 104.745,
          "en": "since we already checked our session here in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.745,
          "end": 106.16,
          "en": "getServerSideProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.16,
          "end": 108.85,
          "en": "when we loaded slash profile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.85,
          "end": 111.47,
          "en": "we already know that we are authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.47,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "So this is actually a redundant request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.3,
          "end": 116.32,
          "en": "which is being sent here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.32,
          "end": 118.16,
          "en": "And we can avoid it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.16,
          "end": 120.95,
          "en": "by using a extra component offered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.95,
          "end": 125.21,
          "en": "by next off in our _app.JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.21,
          "end": 128.76,
          "en": "So in this file which wraps all our page components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.76,
          "end": 130.43,
          "en": "which are being rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.43,
          "end": 135.43,
          "en": "We can import the special Provider component from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.74,
          "end": 138.003,
          "en": "next-auth/client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.48,
          "end": 140.54,
          "en": "This is a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.54,
          "end": 144.32999999999998,
          "en": "which we can wrap around all our other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.32999999999998,
          "end": 147.3,
          "en": "So around the layout and de nested components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.05,
          "end": 150.95,
          "en": "and then Provider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.95,
          "end": 155.95,
          "en": "once a session prop, and here we simply set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.43,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "any session data, which we might already have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 161.53,
          "en": "Now, the interesting thing is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.53,
          "end": 164.6,
          "en": "that here in this root app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.6,
          "end": 168.011,
          "en": "we don't just get the page component that should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.011,
          "end": 171.01,
          "en": "but all of the Props for that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.01,
          "end": 174.07,
          "en": "So the Props determined by get static Props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.07,
          "end": 176.497,
          "en": "or getServerSideProps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.497,
          "end": 179.41,
          "en": "and at least for our profile page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.41,
          "end": 182.27,
          "en": "these Props will contain a session key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.27,
          "end": 187.27,
          "en": "with the session we validated inside of getServerSideProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.92,
          "end": 191.49,
          "en": "So we are setting this session Prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.49,
          "end": 195.79,
          "en": "on this profile page and we are setting it to this session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.79,
          "end": 197.37,
          "en": "which we already loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.37,
          "end": 200.323,
          "en": "and validated with that service side code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.41,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "That means that not all our pages, but some pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 208.8,
          "en": "in this case, the Profile page we'll have a session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.8,
          "end": 211.72,
          "en": "Prop with session data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.72,
          "end": 213.28,
          "en": "So we can set the session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.28,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "for this Provider component equal to pageProps.session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.8,
          "end": 221.24,
          "en": "In most cases, this will be undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.24,
          "end": 224.079,
          "en": "because most pages don't have this Prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.079,
          "end": 228.11,
          "en": "but our profile page, for example, does have it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.11,
          "end": 231.53,
          "en": "And then the session is already set to this already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.53,
          "end": 233.31,
          "en": "loaded session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.31,
          "end": 238.31,
          "en": "And that then allows next off to skip the extra session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 238.32999999999998,
          "end": 241.01,
          "en": "check performed by use session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.01,
          "end": 241.843,
          "en": "If we already have the session from our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.843,
          "end": 245.453,
          "en": "getServeSideProp function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.62,
          "end": 249.63,
          "en": "Now, if we loaded number of component, where does this not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.63,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "set session is on the find and use session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 256.12,
          "en": "We'll still do its thing and check it manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.12,
          "end": 259.9,
          "en": "But in cases where we already know that there is a session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 259.9,
          "end": 262.84,
          "en": "we can save some performance and a wide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.84,
          "end": 265.7,
          "en": "some redundant HTTP requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.7,
          "end": 268.78,
          "en": "And that's never a bad thing simply by wrapping our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 268.78,
          "end": 272.24,
          "en": "Application with this extra provider component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.24,
          "end": 276.03,
          "en": "and utilizing the information which we already have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.03,
          "end": 279.65999999999997,
          "en": "now here in my case, I actually still see this extra session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 279.65999999999997,
          "end": 282.35,
          "en": "request being made here thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.35,
          "end": 284.73,
          "en": "Next off will have its reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.73,
          "end": 289.13,
          "en": "Nonetheless, using this provider wrapper, is a recommended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 289.13,
          "end": 293.344,
          "en": "pattern because it theoretically or practically allows next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.344,
          "end": 297.6,
          "en": "off to optimize itself internally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.6,
          "end": 299.36,
          "en": "and skip certain checks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.36,
          "end": 301.99,
          "en": "and possibly HTTP requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.99,
          "end": 304.198,
          "en": "Even though we unfortunately don't see that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.198,
          "end": 306.894,
          "en": "nonetheless, adding this extra wrapper is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.894,
          "end": 309.16,
          "en": "a recommended optimization",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.16,
          "end": 312.423,
          "en": "which idea for, of course also a wanted to show to You.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
